Cell["\<\
Why this shape? The ends of the wire are open circuits \[LongDash] charge has \
nowhere to go, so the current must vanish there. The feed in the middle is \
where we pump charge in. The result is a standing wave of current, shaped \
like half a cosine, peaking at the feed. This current distribution is the \
single most important thing to understand about a dipole: the radiation and \
the impedance both follow from it.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9901993326421633`*^9},
 CellID->1928732409,ExpressionUUID->"121330dc-8a4f-4589-9131-20ef429e441a"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Input Impedance and Resonance", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990199381458539*^9, 3.9901993856686983`*^9}},
 CellID->2065549171,ExpressionUUID->"59eae5c6-6c6f-4b6d-ad7c-f7e7a5a1954e"],

Cell["\<\
To drive current into the antenna, the source sees an input impedance at the \
feed. It has two parts:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.990199364664076*^9, {3.990199400437661*^9, 3.990199409492728*^9}},
 CellID->1788600791,ExpressionUUID->"0dac7f43-1eae-44eb-81de-20ab502800ae"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["R", TraditionalForm]], "InlineMath",ExpressionUUID->
  "31d68c46-ea5a-4401-9b2f-3f0c7c7ace64"],
 " (resistance) represents power that leaves \[LongDash] mostly radiation \
resistance, the useful power turned into radio waves."
}], "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990199430382771*^9, 3.9901994571319113`*^9}},
 CellID->950784766,ExpressionUUID->"015fa58e-0fcc-4086-90d3-1d3094d0fb36"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["X", TraditionalForm]], "InlineMath",ExpressionUUID->
  "bf029db7-88fa-49cb-afe2-5faef98a6bb9"],
 " (reactance) represents energy that sloshes back and forth between the \
antenna's electric and magnetic fields without leaving \[LongDash] like a \
capacitor or inductor. Reactance does no radiating; it just makes the antenna \
harder to feed."
}], "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.99019944503094*^9, 3.990199460765544*^9}},
 CellID->575534940,ExpressionUUID->"cc6c013c-2a8d-4aba-bace-c1862e3ba8f2"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["AntennaLink reports this directly:", "MathCaption",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990199491011585*^9, 3.990199499448833*^9}},
 CellID->1200095730,ExpressionUUID->"98b2cb18-52af-4caf-8822-4daa6c8c02aa"],

